    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>Environmental Systems come in two varieties: Cold-Weather Systems and Warm-Weather Systems. It is possible to install both in the same suit of Armor, but doing so counts as two separate Upgrades. An Environmental System makes you immune to the effects of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Extreme_Cold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Extreme Cold\">Extreme Cold</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Extreme_Heat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Extreme Heat\">Extreme Heat</a>, as appropriate. </p>",
